nst Staphylococcus aureus. <source>Immunity.</source> <volume>24</volume>:<fpage>79</fpage>&#x02013;91.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16413925</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib38"><label>38</label><citation citation-type="journal">Woo, P. <year>2006</year>. Systemic juvenile idiopathic arthritis: diagnosis, management, and outcome. <source>Nat. Clin. Pract. Rheumatol.</source> <volume>2</volume>:<fpage>28</fpage>&#x02013;34.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16932649</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib39"><label>39</label><citation citation-type="journal">Bhardwaj, N., L.L. Lau, S.M. Friedman, M.K. Crow, and R.M. Steinman. <year>1989</year>. Interleukin 1 production during accessory cell-dependent mitogenesis of T lymphocytes. <source>J. Exp. Med.</source> <volume>169</volume>:<fpage>1121</fpage>&#x02013;1136.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2522495</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib40"><label>40</label><citation citation-type="journal">Prieur, A.M., C. Bremard-Oury, C. Griscelli, and P. Mozziconacci. <year>1984</year>. Prognosis of the systemic forms of juvenile chronic arthritis. Apropos of 100 cases. <source>Arch. Fr. Pediatr.</source> <volume>41</volume>:<fpage>91</fpage>&#x02013;97.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6721667</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib41"><label>41</label><citation citation-type="journal">Ramilo, O., W. Allman, W. Chung, A. Mejias, M. Ardura, C. Glaser, K.M. Wittkowski, B. Piqueras, J. Banchereau, A.K. Palucka, and D. Chaussabel. <year>2007</year>. Gene expression patterns in blood leukocytes discriminate patients with acute infections. <source>Blood.</source> <volume>109</volume>:<fpage>2066</fpage>&#x02013;2077.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17105821</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>